	quest.21E297185EFFD3AE.title: "[&bRepeatable&r] &cIfrit"
	quest.222C787901E00F46.title: "Heavy Slash"
	quest.227FE645AE3FE5EA.quest_subtitle: "- Slay Blade Tiger"
	quest.227FE645AE3FE5EA.title: "Blade Tiger"
	quest.25E33F080BB60AA6.quest_desc: [
		"[&6TIP&r]:"
		""
		"Dont worry about dying it will teleport you outside arena with 1HP"
	]
	quest.25E33F080BB60AA6.quest_subtitle: "&aFight the Elemental Colossus and \"die\"."
	quest.25E33F080BB60AA6.title: "&aChill! It's just a test!"
	quest.26665ECCA70AB09D.quest_subtitle: "- Slay &4Rimuru"
	quest.26665ECCA70AB09D.title: "&4Ruler of monsters"
	quest.26CA895B58C2516F.quest_subtitle: "- Slay Wither"
	quest.26CA895B58C2516F.title: "Warden"
	quest.281EE43E7298BE44.title: "[Repeatable] Enchantments [Random]"
	quest.29C58FCC27F71727.quest_subtitle: "- Slay Wither"
	quest.29C58FCC27F71727.title: "Wither"
	quest.29F819AC9FC0A460.quest_subtitle: "- Sacrifice &bBlock of Pure Magisteel&r"
	quest.29F819AC9FC0A460.title: "[&bRepeatable&r] &cMetal Slime&r"
	quest.2A2FA78C2C6CE063.title: "Gold Coin"
	quest.2A3CFD1FA2C15A70.title: "[Repeatable] Battlewill [Random]"
	quest.2B765B880EFEF7EE.title: "[Repeatable] Battlewill [Choice]"
	quest.2C3D4E5F6A7B8C9D.quest_desc: [
		"Want to pipe items automatically into a furnace array, or suck monster loot drops directly out of a mob farm chest into your master terminal?"
		""
		"Use the **Inventory Hopper** and **Inventory Cable Connector** blocks."
		""
		"Attach a Cable Connector to your auto-farms or auxiliary machinery chests to cleanly bridge external items directly into the master storage logic loop automatically."
	]
	quest.2C3D4E5F6A7B8C9D.title: "&eAutomated Extraction"
	quest.2C7FD65CE6F9398A.quest_subtitle: "- Kill 25x &bAqua Frog&r ( Can be Summon )"
	quest.2C7FD65CE6F9398A.title: "[&bRepeatable&r] &bUndine"
	quest.2D996575E1D5F897.quest_desc: [
		"Are you prepared to walk the path of absolute corruption for a glimpse of godlike capability?"
		""
		"Put on the **Ring of the Seven Curses**."
		""
		"**The Pact**: Once equipped, this ring *cannot be removed* normally. Monsters will hit harder, fire will burn hotter, and bad luck will follow you. In exchange, the world drops legendary loot, your raw attack damage skyrockets, and your evolution rates speed up drastically."
		""
		"Choose wisely—this curse is absolute."
	]
	quest.2D996575E1D5F897.quest_subtitle: "Forbidden power, absolute price."
	quest.2D996575E1D5F897.title: "&4The Seven Curses"
	quest.3001A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to high-tier industrial engineering. **Mekanism** allows you to manipulate elements down to the atomic level, multiplying resource yields up to five times."
		""
		"To begin your industrial journey, look deep underground for **Osmium Ore**. Combine it with iron to build your very first mechanical chassis: the **Metallurgic Infuser**."
		""
		"This machine forces carbon or redstone into base elements, creating the advanced alloys needed for all future tier tech."
	]
	quest.3001A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_subtitle: "Smashing atoms together."
	quest.3001A2B3C4D5E6F7.title: "&6The Infusion Mainframe"
	quest.3002A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_desc: [
		"Every machine requires power (Joule or FE). Let's start clean by generating green energy using **Mekanism Generators**."
		""
		"**Wind Generator**: Place it high in the sky. The higher up you anchor it, the more passive energy it pumps out."
		""
		"**Heat Generator**: Early game burning chamber. Stuff it with coal or place it directly adjacent to lava source blocks for passive thermal transfer power."
	]
	quest.3002A2B3C4D5E6F7.title: "&bMainframe Power Grid"
	quest.3003A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_desc: [
		"With basic alloys unlocked, you can upgrade standard vanilla tool sets using **Mekanism Tools** alloys."
		""
		"Craft the **Osmium Pickaxe** or step up to the legendary **Atomic Disassembler**."
		""
		"The Atomic Disassembler is a multi-tool that can be toggled between various mining speeds (Slow, Fast, Vein, Extended Vein), cutting through rock walls instantly!"
	]
	quest.3003A2B3C4D5E6F7.title: "&bHeavy Utility Gear"
	quest.3004A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_desc: [
		"To multiply your ores, you must move beyond traditional smelting. Enter the processing line."
		""
		"**Enrichment Chamber**: Bakes raw chunks down into dusts, giving you a baseline **2x Ore Multiplication**."
		""
		"**Energized Smelter**: An advanced electric furnace that instantly smelts those dusts down into pristine metal ingots."
	]
	quest.3004A2B3C4D5E6F7.title: "&bDuplication processing"
	quest.3005A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_desc: [
		"Ready to master chemistry? By combining fluids, gases, and digital storage networks, you can process Mekanism's complex chemical loops automatically."
		""
		"**Applied Mekanistics** bridges Applied Energistics 2 directly into Mekanism. Craft the **Chemical Interface** and **Chemical Storage Cells**."
		""
		"These components allow your digital AE2 network to natively read, store, auto-craft, and pump gases like Oxygen, Hydrogen, and Sulfuric Acid directly into your processing machines without a single messy pipe block!"
	]
	quest.3005A2B3C4D5E6F7.title: "&aDigital Gas Management"
	quest.3006A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_desc: [
		"Early game wind power won't sustain particle accelerators or multi-block processing factories. We need nuclear capability."
		""
		"Assemble a **Gas-Burning Generator** fed with ethylene gas, or go all out and engineer a massive multi-block **Fission Reactor**."
		""
		"Running fission yields terrifying amounts of energy, but produce your coolant loops carefully—a core meltdown will completely vaporize your base!"
	]
	quest.3006A2B3C4D5E6F7.title: "&eQuantum Energy Generation"
	quest.3007A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_desc: [
		"The pinnacle of atomic evolution. Fusing advanced tech with your player frame."
		""
		"Craft the full multi-module **MekaSuit** armor set along with the high-frequency wireless **Digital Assembly Matrix**."
		""
		"The MekaSuit can be upgraded with data modules to grant absolute immunity to all magic/physical damage, cross-dimensional wireless energy transfer, and infinite flight power!"
	]
	quest.3007A2B3C4D5E6F7.title: "&5The Singularity Exoskeleton"
	quest.3074B19562C77379.quest_subtitle: "- Slay &4Luminous Valentine"
	quest.3074B19562C77379.title: "&4Queen of Nightmares"
	quest.312482FF65AE25E7.title: "Maximum Magic Bullet"
	quest.3151292A323656BA.quest_desc: [
		"Let the &3cold&r of the &9depths cradle&r your soul — awaken the &bInfused Seashelf&r."
		""
		"Its &6core&r hums with &barcane memory&r and channels &9forgotten enchantments&r through &3frozen tides&r."
		""
		"&7Beneath still ice, ancient power waits in slumber eternal."
	]
	quest.3151292A323656BA.title: "&eSleeping in the Cold Below"
	quest.3152EC0DD95B34ED.quest_subtitle: "- Slay 3x Wither Skeleton"
	quest.3152EC0DD95B34ED.title: "Wither Skeleton"
	quest.324028DB663B9C89.title: "[&aBuy&r] &6Master&r &eBody Double&r [&e10 Gold Coins&r]"
	quest.333A576770B576EE.quest_subtitle: "- Slay &4Ifrit"
	quest.333A576770B576EE.title: "Ifrit"
	quest.333EAC908C17EFE6.quest_subtitle: "- &cKill&r 10x &6Hound Dog"
	quest.333EAC908C17EFE6.title: "Hound Dogs"
	quest.336CE554DE601D62.quest_subtitle: "- Sacrifice &bPure Magisteel Ingot&r and 64x &bMedium Quality Magic Crystal"
	quest.336CE554DE601D62.title: "[&bRepeatable&r] &6Otherworlder Spawn egg&r [&aRandom&r]"
	quest.33D8D33D7F522FBA.quest_subtitle: "- Slay &4Carrion"
	quest.33D8D33D7F522FBA.title: "&4Beast Master"
	quest.33F290DE693FD5E3.title: "Stellar Gold Coin"
	quest.370B78BF3E82EE8A.quest_subtitle: "- &cKill&r 100x &6Direwolf&r to &asummon&r their &6boss"
	quest.370B78BF3E82EE8A.title: "[&bRepeatable&r] &6Ranga"
	quest.37B83F8C86E586A1.quest_desc: [
		"You've &2delved&r into &cfire&r and &3plunged&r through &5depths&r..."
		""
		"Now, &aenchant&r an item at &eLevel 60&r to &6wield&r power beyond &d*mortal* limits&r."
		""
		"The forces of &4Hell&r and &3Sea&r now &6bend&r to your will."
	]
	quest.37B83F8C86E586A1.title: "&6Mastering&r the &4Hell&r and &bSea"
	quest.382B46786E2C735D.quest_desc: [
		"Take your culinary arts to the absolute peak maximum. Gather premium ingredients to construct a **Shepherd's Pie** or a grand **Roast Chicken Dinner** feast block."
		""
		"Placing these feast blocks down lets you and your entire server party slice off multiple servings, giving everyone immense status buffs right before major dimension boss raids!"
	]
	quest.382B46786E2C735D.title: "&eThe Banquet of Champions"
	quest.3ABEC4846DEB50DC.quest_subtitle: "- Kill 25x &aFeathered Serpent&r ( Can be Summon )"
	quest.3ABEC4846DEB50DC.title: "[&bRepeatable&r] &aSylphide"
	quest.3C05A6C992B9128F.title: "Ogre-Sword Cannon"
	quest.3C4D5E6F7A8B9C1D.quest_desc: [
		"A single chest attached to a terminal isn't very helpful. To build a true network, you need a brain."
		""
		"The **Inventory Connector** is the absolute core block of your storage system. Place your Terminal against it, and then run **Inventory Cable** out to touch your various chests."
		""
		"Every single chest touching a connected cable will now feed directly into your central terminal screen!"
	]
	quest.3C4D5E6F7A8B9C1D.title: "&bWiring the Network"
	quest.3CE3FADF0130C9DF.quest_subtitle: "- Slay 3x Giant Bat"
	quest.3CE3FADF0130C9DF.title: "Giant Bat"
	quest.3D2DDABECE8830B8.quest_subtitle: "Donate 1x Stellar coin to get 100x Gold coins"
	quest.3D2DDABECE8830B8.title: "Exchange &aStellar&r coin for &6Gold&r coins"
	quest.3D49EA3C2AFDC6D5.quest_desc: [
		"[&6???&r] &bSunWine&r:"
		"  "
		"\"So, you’ve chosen to take your first step into the &l&bEcho of Resolve&r. A humble beginning, yet one that has broken many before you.\""
		""
		"\"Don’t let the simplicity fool you, this is where the unworthy falter, and only the steadfast press on.\""
	]
	quest.3D49EA3C2AFDC6D5.quest_subtitle: "&cProve Yourself Worthy"
	quest.3D49EA3C2AFDC6D5.title: "&l&6Echo of Resolve"
	quest.3ED3EE6D145B8470.quest_desc: [
		"Looking for a massive defensive boost when diving down into dark labyrinth trees or dealing with high-rank monsters?"
		""
		"Forge the full set of **Etherium Armor**."
		""
		"This set naturally grants heavy magic protection values, buffers incoming spiritual damage, and reduces the stamina cost of your active skills!"
	]
	quest.3ED3EE6D145B8470.title: "&bChitin of the Archmage"
	quest.3F95C0C012CB81D8.quest_desc: [
		"[&6TIP&f]"
		"Its the biggest tree you will see hard to miss!"
		""
		"If you are struggling to find a labyrinth tree, make sure to use your trusty [&l&6Explorer's Compass&r]"
	]
	quest.3F95C0C012CB81D8.quest_subtitle: "Find and enter &aLabyrinth tree"
	quest.3F95C0C012CB81D8.title: "&a[Dungeon Encroachment]"
	quest.4001A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_desc: [
		"Deep beneath the surface in dark, forgotten caverns stands a silent guardian. The **Ferrous Wroughtnaut** is a massive, heavily armored knight that cannot be damaged by conventional front-facing attacks."
		""
		"**The Trial**: Wait for him to strike his heavy axe down into the stone floor. While he is stuck attempting to pry his weapon free, sprint behind him and strike his exposed, glowing red jewel!"
		""
		"Defeating him grants the **Wrought Helmet** (making you completely unbreakable from headshots) and the **Axe of a Thousand Metals**."
	]
	quest.4001A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_subtitle: "The Unyielding Guardian."
	quest.4001A2B3C4D5E6F7.title: "&6The Ferrous Wroughtnaut"
	quest.4002A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_desc: [
		"Deep within savannah biomes, a small tribe of aggressive natives guards their sacred ground. Leading them is the **Barakoa Chief, Barako the Sun Chief**."
		""
		"**The Trial**: Barako remains seated on his throne, conjuring bursts of solar energy and summoning endless waves of his tribe masked warriors to protect him. Weaken his defenses and put an end to his reign."
		""
		"Defeating him allows you to claim the **Sol Visage**, granting you the ability to summon your own loyal Barakoa followers into battle!"
	]
	quest.4002A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_subtitle: "The King of the Savanna."
	quest.4002A2B3C4D5E6F7.title: "&eBarako, the Sun Chief"
	quest.4003A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_desc: [
		"High up on the freezing peaks of snowy mountain ranges lives the frost entity known as the **Frostmaw**. It guards its most precious treasure: the **Ice Crystal**."
		""
		"**The Trial**: Approach while it is deep in slumber to attempt to steal the crystal out of its claws—but beware! If it wakes, you will face an unrelenting barrage of absolute-zero ice breaths and crushing physical strikes."
		""
		"Slaying the beast allows you to cleanly wield the **Ice Crystal**, letting you cast powerful ice spells that freeze entire fields of enemies instantly."
	]
	quest.4003A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_subtitle: "The Terror of the Ice Peaks."
	quest.4003A2B3C4D5E6F7.title: "&bThe Frostmaw"
	quest.4004A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_desc: [
		"You have successfully navigated the trickiest combat mechanics the wilderness could throw at you."
		""
		"By slaying the Wroughtnaut, overcoming the Sun Chief's armies, and besting the mountain Frostmaw, your martial capabilities are undeniable."
		""
		"Claim this ultimate bounty as a grand champion of the hunt!"
	]
	quest.4004A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_subtitle: "Conqueror of legends."
	quest.4004A2B3C4D5E6F7.title: "&5&lApex Predator of the Realm"
	quest.4076077138CA8E4E.quest_desc: ["Show &6everyone&r you &ahave&r that &cdawg&r in &ayou"]
	quest.4076077138CA8E4E.quest_subtitle: "- Requires &anaming&r a &6Hound Dog&r with &csnake tail"
	quest.4076077138CA8E4E.title: "&9Summon Hound Dog"
	quest.409D77EC8FCCE8E0.quest_subtitle: "Donate 100x Silver coin to get 1x Gold coin"
	quest.409D77EC8FCCE8E0.title: "Exchange &aSilver&r coins for &6Gold&r coin"
	quest.41F0CCCA441B22AE.quest_desc: [
		"Before you can safely wear complex relics, you must unlock your body's hidden potential. Every sorcerer requires a focal lens."
		""
		"Craft the **Enigmatic Amulet**. While resting in your Curios neck slot, it increases your max health and baseline magic processing limits."
		""
		"Keep it equipped—this amulet acts as a protective shield, dampening backfiring magical energies from chaotic artifacts."
	]
	quest.41F0CCCA441B22AE.title: "&bThe Soul anchor"
	quest.4278DD7A9B2F4156.quest_desc: [
		"[&6Receptionist&r] &bSunwyne&r:"
		""
		"\"Several creepers have been spotted around the land. They're not combatants, but having walking bombs around the land is dangerous.\""
		""
		"\"We need you to hunt them down, and please stay caution when engaging in combat\""
	]
	quest.4278DD7A9B2F4156.quest_subtitle: "- Slay 5x Creeper"
	quest.4278DD7A9B2F4156.title: "&l&aSurprise Party"
	quest.42DFC0859D92C3D3.title: "[&aBuy&r] &6Master&r &eTime Manipulation&r [&e10 Gold Coins&r]"
	quest.43D6538075EA2329.quest_subtitle: "- Kill 300x &cOrc"
	quest.43D6538075EA2329.title: "[&bRepeatable&r] &4Orc Disaster"
	quest.4472F69B8D0E9D4C.quest_subtitle: "- Slay Ender Dragon"
	quest.4472F69B8D0E9D4C.title: "Ender Dragon"
	quest.4593A6557082F4C0.quest_desc: [
		"Each armor parts contain following bonuses they are just hidden"
		""
		"[&6BONUSES&r]:"
		"+&c25&r &6Armor&r"
		"+&c15&r &6Armor Toughness&r"
		"+&c1&r &6Knockback Resistance&r"
		"+&c1&r &6Max Health&r (&e+100%&r bonus)"
		"+&c1&r &6Max Spiritual Health&r (&e+100%&r bonus)"
		"+&c1&r &6Max Magicule&r (&e+100%&r bonus)"
		"+&c1&r &6Max Aura&r (&e+100%&r bonus)"
		"&6Blast Protection&r X"
		"&6Fire Protection&r X"
		"&6Projectile Protection&r X"
		"&6Protection&r X"
		"&6Thorns&r X"
		"&6Unbreaking&r X"
		"&aMending&r"
		"&bBreathing Support&r I"
		"&eElemental Boost&r X"
		"&eElemental Resistance&r X"
		"&bSturdy&r X"
		"&aUnbreakable&r"
	]
	quest.4593A6557082F4C0.quest_subtitle: "Was... is worth it?"
	quest.4593A6557082F4C0.title: "&l&4Celestial Blood-Forged Armor"
	quest.4716E440A55C661E.title: "Bronze Coin"
	quest.4A5B6C7D8E9F1A2B.quest_desc: [
		"Standing right in front of your base terminal to pull items can get restrictive when working on massive machinery or potion labs."
		""
		"Craft a **Wireless Storage Terminal** along with an **Inventory Wireless Antenna**."
		""
		"Place the Antenna directly on top of your central Inventory Connector block. As long as you are within a **16-block radius**, you can open your base terminal anywhere by right-clicking the device in your hand!"
	]
	quest.4A5B6C7D8E9F1A2B.title: "&dUnchained Access"
	quest.4AC58A62F864B7F3.quest_subtitle: "- &cKill&r Each &aLesser Spirit&r x5"
	quest.4AC58A62F864B7F3.title: "[&bRepeatable&r] &6Greater Spirits&r [&aRandom&r]"
	quest.4B8CB247E366C890.title: "&l&bMonster Spawner&r"
	quest.4C13A2A30DD2C1AB.quest_desc: [
		"Sixteen blocks of range isn't quite enough when exploring deep labyrinth trees or hunting bosses across dimensions."
		""
		"Upgrade your signal strength to the absolute peak maximum by fusing your tech with rare minerals."
		""
		"The **Adv. Wireless Terminal** breaks past standard local area range limitations, allowing you to access your entire base inventory globally across any distance!"
	]
	quest.4C13A2A30DD2C1AB.title: "&5Dimensional Frequency"
	quest.4D6B820E903DE2B0.quest_subtitle: "- Slay 1x Evoker"
	quest.4D6B820E903DE2B0.title: "Evoker"
	quest.4F88195F3EE874BB.quest_subtitle: "- Slay &aSylphide"
	quest.4F88195F3EE874BB.title: "Sylphide"
	quest.5001A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_desc: [
		"Deep inside the obsidian chambers of the **Ruined Citadel** in the Nether, a monstrous suit of animated magma plate armor guards the core."
		""
		"The **Ignis** wields devastating shockwaves, shields itself from incoming projectiles, and unleashes absolute infernos. Watch its stance—when it charges up, prepare to dodge or utilize spatial evasion skills."
		""
		"Defeating this titan lets you forge the unstoppable **Ignitium Armor** set or claim the **Bulwark of the Flame**!"
	]
	quest.5001A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_subtitle: "The Scorched Warlord."
	quest.5001A2B3C4D5E6F7.title: "&cThe Ignis"
	quest.5002A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_desc: [
		"Submerged deep within the ocean depths inside the ancient water monuments known as the **Sunken City**, lies an abyssal biological weapon."
		""
		"The **The Harbinger** is a colossal biomechanical mechanical crustacean powered by ancient redstone technology. It charges at intruders, snaps with heavy hydraulic claws, and fires catastrophic high-frequency redstone lasers."
		""
		"Slay the machine to secure the **Witherite Ingot** paths and craft the high-frequency **Wrangler** or **Mechanical Goggle** matrices!"
	]
	quest.5002A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_subtitle: "Abyssal Cybernetics."
	quest.5002A2B3C4D5E6F7.title: "&1The Harbinger"
	quest.5003A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_desc: [
		"Buried deep inside the desert sands within the massive subterranean sandstone labyrinths known as the **Cursed Pyramid**, an undying pharaoh slumbers."
		""
		"The **AnAncient Remnant** uses shifting sandstorms, toxic sand hazards, and ancient status curses to break your mind. Bring heavy magic resistance or nullification tools into this arena."
		""
		"Defeating this dusty monolith yields the **Desert Robe** components and fragments of the legendary **Remnant's Staff**!"
	]
	quest.5003A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_subtitle: "Grave of the Pharaoh."
	quest.5003A2B3C4D5E6F7.title: "&eThe Ancient Remnant"
	quest.5004A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_desc: [
		"Floating high within End dimension anomalies, inside the colossal flying fortresses known as the **Ruined Space Station**, stands the true peak executioner of the void."
		""
		"The **Ender Guardian** manipulates gravitational fields, blinks through multidimensional portals, and slams down with weight metrics that can instantly shatter your barrier systems."
		""
		"Slaying this cosmic god rewards you with the **Void Core** modules, unlocking the path to craft the reality-tearing **Void Forge Greatsword**!"
	]
	quest.5004A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_subtitle: "The Overseer of the Void."
	quest.5004A2B3C4D5E6F7.title: "&5The Ender Guardian"
	quest.5005A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_desc: [
		"You have successfully systematically executed the most dangerous calamities roaming this planet and the void above."
		""
		"By cleansing the Citadel, dismantling the ocean mainframe, purging the desert ruins, and sealing the cosmic station, your position as a true Apex predator is undeniable."
		""
		"Claim this ultimate bounty as a grand mythic conqueror!"
	]
	quest.5005A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_subtitle: "Calamity Extinguished."
	quest.5005A2B3C4D5E6F7.title: "&d&l&kO&r &5The End of All Calamities &d&l&kO&r"
	quest.50CF30C4C8B4D1B0.quest_desc: [
		"You've &9reached&r where few dare to &3dive&r."
		""
		"&dChannel&r forbidden &5knowledge&r and &benchant&r an item at &eLevel 80&r."
		""
		"The &5depths&r whisper &esecrets&r no surface &amage&r could ever &6comprehend."
	]
	quest.50CF30C4C8B4D1B0.title: "&9Enchantments&r from the &5Depths&r"
	quest.50F6684609409B26.quest_subtitle: "- Slay &2War Gnome"
	quest.50F6684609409B26.title: "War Gnome"
	quest.515F18C2A1593CA2.quest_desc: [
		"You've &alearned&r the &dbasics&r — now put &bthem&r to &cuse&r."
		""
		"Enchant an &citem&r at &eLevel 30&r to &aunlock&r its &6true&r potential."
		""
		"Even the &7humblest tool&r can &6shine&r with &5arcane power&r."
	]
	quest.515F18C2A1593CA2.title: "&eThe Basics"
	quest.5261B5229F9B426D.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to a world of deeply forgotten curios, forbidden relics, and dark magic. **Enigmatic Legacy** introduces powerful trinkets that grant immense power, but often demand an equally grand price."
		""
		"To begin channeling these ancient forces, venture into the deepest layers of the world to mine **Etherium Ore**."
		""
		"Smelt it down into **Etherium Ingots**—this shimmering, magical metal serves as the core foundation for crafting advanced charms, rings, and armor."
	]
	quest.5261B5229F9B426D.quest_subtitle: "The alloy of mystical essence."
	quest.5261B5229F9B426D.title: "&6The Shimmering Catalyst"
	quest.5296B7156620088E.quest_subtitle: "- Slay &5Akash"
	quest.5296B7156620088E.title: "Akash"
	quest.52E6FC74A911A071.quest_desc: [
		"Hidden deep inside the sprawling stone hallways of subterranean brick **Labyrinths**, the half-man, half-bull monstrosity stands guard."
		""
		"The **Minoshroom** wields a massive, fiery greataxe and charges blindly down narrow hallways. Put down its charging rampages to progress."
		""
		"Slaying the beast lets you claim the **Mazebreaker Pickaxe** from hidden vault rooms or cook up powerful **Meef Stroganoff** to bypass the fiery biome environmental lock!"
	]
	quest.52E6FC74A911A071.title: "&cThe Minoshroom Labyrinth"
	quest.5641A4D982250D0F.quest_subtitle: "Donate 1x Gold coin to get 100x Silver coins"
	quest.5641A4D982250D0F.title: "Exchange &aGold&r coin for &6Silver&r coins"
	quest.57B379D3E1C32233.quest_desc: [
		"Tired of basic cooked steaks that barely scratch your hunger bar? Let's get cooking."
		""
		"Craft a **Cooking Pot** and place it directly over an active heat source (like a furnace, campfire, or Stove)."
		""
		"Combine wild vegetables, tomatoes, and sliced meats to brew advanced stews and feasts that grant powerful, long-lasting health regeneration and strength buffs!"
	]
	quest.57B379D3E1C32233.title: "&bGourmet Assembly"
	quest.57EAEFF8DA6EFD7C.quest_subtitle: "- Sacrifice 25x &2Beast Gnome&r ( Can be Summon )"
	quest.57EAEFF8DA6EFD7C.title: "[&bRepeatable&r] &2War Gnome"
	quest.586A723D5C99E394.quest_subtitle: "- Kill 25x &5Winged Cat&r ( Can be Summon )"
	quest.586A723D5C99E394.title: "[&bRepeatable&r] &5Akash"
	quest.5A00DA96EC533FF3.quest_desc: [
		"[&6Blacksmith&r] &bSunWine&r:"
		"  "
		"\"Well, well... If it isn’t one of the realm’s finest gracing my humble forge. An &bS-Rank&r adventurer, no less. The stories didn’t lie, you’ve got the air of a legend about you.\""
		""
		"\"Welcome to the &l&bCelestial Forge&r, where steel meets the divine and mortal hands shape the tools of gods and heroes. I’m &bSunWine&r, the smith who turns myths into metal.\""
		""
		"\"You wouldn’t be here if you were after some common blade. No, you’re here for something worthy, something that'll truly be fit for a person of your power\""
		""
		"\"So tell me, hero... what kind of legend do you need me to forge for you? A weapon that splits the heavens? Impenetrable Armor? Just say the word, and I'll do my best to make it a reality\""
	]
	quest.5A00DA96EC533FF3.quest_subtitle: "- Requires [&bS&r] - Rank Missions unlocked"
	quest.5A00DA96EC533FF3.title: "&l&bThe Celestial Forge&r"
	quest.5A11B6BB0FFEFCE9.quest_desc: [
		"Each of the weapons contains the same bonuses its just hidden, only difference is attack speed and what you like."
		""
		"[&6BONUSES&r]:"
		"- &6Every&r &dElemental Core&r"
