	quest.5A11B6BB0FFEFCE9.quest_subtitle: "- It's damage is over 9000"
	quest.5A11B6BB0FFEFCE9.title: "&l&bLegendary Weapon&r"
	quest.5ACC24FC3B65E21C.quest_subtitle: "- Slay Unicorn"
	quest.5ACC24FC3B65E21C.title: "Unicorn"
	quest.5B4AC92911A286C5.quest_desc: [
		"Step away from the mortal realm and step into a dimension of eternal twilight. Surrounded by massive canopy trees, ancient ruins, and powerful mythical creatures."
		""
		"**The Portal**: Dig a 2x2 pool of water, surround the edges flat with flowers, and throw a glistening **Diamond** directly into the water to trigger a lightning strike that opens the gateway!"
	]
	quest.5B4AC92911A286C5.quest_subtitle: "Entering the realm of twilight."
	quest.5B4AC92911A286C5.title: "&6The Canopy Threshold"
	quest.5B6CE04022CB2B71.quest_desc: [
		"Embrace the &4unholy flames&r — obtain a &cHellshelf&r."
		""
		"It feeds on &6power&r, grows with &5madness&r, and fuels your &cforbidden enchantments&r."
		""
		"&8Not all knowledge was meant to be bound in books."
	]
	quest.5B6CE04022CB2B71.title: "&4&lThe Chaos of Hell&r"
	quest.5BE5299CA8AFB471.title: "Purchase: Unique Skill Reroll"
	quest.5BEA95E79F7AF9F1.quest_desc: [
		"Unlocks the peak execution tier of magical artifacts. By capturing souls or using dark alchemy scrolls, you can craft the **Scroll of Boundless Infinite**."
		""
		"Reading this scroll grants you a permanent, extra **Curios Slot** of your choice, allowing you to wear an additional ring, charm, or belt relic simultaneously!"
	]
	quest.5BEA95E79F7AF9F1.title: "&eTranscendent Anatomy"
	quest.5CFD663B73E3EB45.title: "Unlock: Your Unique Skill"
	quest.5D137750C7A100DE.quest_subtitle: "- Kill 100x &cOrc"
	quest.5D137750C7A100DE.title: "[&bRepeatable&r] &cOrc Lord Spawn Egg"
	quest.5E97031990B0C8FA.quest_desc: [
		"[&6Receptionist&r] &bSunwyne&r:"
		""
		"\"Witches from the dark cult of Salem are reuniting to summon demons and bring chaos to our land.\""
		""
		"\"Put a stop to their curses and magic and drive them back.\" "
	]
	quest.5E97031990B0C8FA.quest_subtitle: "- Slay 5x Witch"
	quest.5E97031990B0C8FA.title: "&l&2The Cult of Salem"
	quest.6001A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to the ultimate network of interstellar travel. **Stargate Journey** allows you to open stable wormholes across vast distances, bypassing physical dimensions entirely."
		""
		"To begin uncovering the secrets of the Ancients, you must head deep underground to find **Naquadah Ore**."
		""
		"Naquadah is a dense, super-conductive mineral that fuels all Stargate technology. Mine it, smelt it, and prepare to power the network."
	]
	quest.6001A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_subtitle: "The element of the gods."
	quest.6001A2B3C4D5E6F7.title: "&6Naquadah Discovery"
	quest.6002A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_desc: [
		"A Stargate cannot safely establish an event horizon without an immense surge of power."
		""
		"Craft a **Naquadah Generator** to serve as the baseline battery module for your dialing platform."
		""
		"Connect it directly to a **Dialing Computer** or a **DHD (Dial-Home Device)** to supply the continuous power required to lock the stargate's chevrons."
	]
	quest.6002A2B3C4D5E6F7.title: "&bPowering the Mainframe"
	quest.6003A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_desc: [
		"The most recognizable ring in the galaxy. The **Milky Way Stargate** is a robust, mechanical ring utilizing rotating track systems to lock individual address coordinates."
		""
		"Find or craft a Milky Way ring layout. To initialize it, you will need a 7-symbol address sequence pointing to another gate on your network!"
		""
		"**Warning**: Do not step through the gate while the unstable vortex (the 'kawoosh') is exploding outwards, or you will be completely disintegrated!"
	]
	quest.6003A2B3C4D5E6F7.title: "&bMilky Way Network"
	quest.6004A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_desc: [
		"An upgraded, entirely digital design left behind in the Pegasus Galaxy. The **Pegasus Stargate** swaps physical rotation tracks for flashing digital glyph arrays."
		""
		"Pegasus gates engage addresses significantly faster than Milky Way models and possess built-in safety overrides that prevent duplicate dialing frequencies."
	]
	quest.6004A2B3C4D5E6F7.title: "&bPegasus Protocol"
	quest.6005A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_desc: [
		"What if a hostile army tries to march straight through your portal into the heart of your base?"
		""
		"Protect your local portal platform by crafting an **Iris** (for Milky Way gates) or a **Shield** (for Pegasus gates)."
		""
		"When closed over the ring, the Iris completely pulverizes incoming matter before it can materialize on your side. Wire it to a lever or redstone grid to control who comes home!"
	]
	quest.6005A2B3C4D5E6F7.title: "&aMainframe Perimeter Shielding"
	quest.6006A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_desc: [
		"The oldest model in existence, designed by the Ancients for the Destiny expedition. The **Universe Stargate** rotates entirely as a single unified ring."
		""
		"While it has a shorter range and requires a specialized **Universe DHD**, its archaic engineering loops allow it to operate without a complex central computer grid."
	]
	quest.6006A2B3C4D5E6F7.title: "&eArchaic Prototypes"
	quest.6007A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_desc: [
		"Standard stargate connections are restricted to local galaxy clusters using a 7-symbol sequence."
		""
		"To bridge vast dimensional distances or dial ultra-remote coordinates, you must supply immense energy—equivalent to a Zero Point Module (ZPM)—and initiate a **9-Symbol Dialing Protocol**."
		""
		"Mastering the full network structure grants you absolute freedom to traverse the universe instantly!"
	]
	quest.6007A2B3C4D5E6F7.title: "&5&lMaster of the Stargate Network"
	quest.6008A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_desc: [
		"The absolute peak execution of the twilight dimensions hierarchy loops. Scale the cloud platforms to enter the **Glacier Palace**."
		""
		"The **Snow Queen** floats atop a swirling matrix shield of packed ice, slamming the floor to drop devastating blocks of ice spikes down on your coordinates. Dodge her absolute-zero freezing beams to put an end to her winter storm."
	]
	quest.6008A2B3C4D5E6F7.title: "&bThe Aurora Snow Queen"
	quest.6009A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_desc: [
		"You have successfully completely shattered every environmental curse and master boss block structure governing the Twilight Forest."
		""
		"By decapitating the Naga, conquering the Minoshroom, executing the multi-headed Hydra, bouncing scepter magic back at the Lich, putting the Knight Phantoms to rest, silencing the Ur-Ghast, and shattering the Snow Queen's ice throne, your supremacy is absolute."
		""
		"Claim your final reward, Sovereign Protector of the Canopy!"
	]
	quest.6009A2B3C4D5E6F7.title: "&5&l&kO&r &dTwilight Forest Sovereign &5&l&kO&r"
	quest.60E9E86A2B7CF7B2.quest_subtitle: "- Slay &bUndine"
	quest.60E9E86A2B7CF7B2.title: "Undine"
	quest.60FF32B389B5776C.quest_desc: [
		"Cast your line out into unique biomes—such as desert oases, swamp tides, or deep freezing ocean shelves."
		""
		"Catch a **Arapaima**, a **Halibut**, or a rare biome-specific species. Bringing them back to your Cutting Board allows you to cleanly fillet them down into vast quantities of premium fish slices for your Cooking Pot!"
	]
	quest.60FF32B389B5776C.title: "&bDeep Sea Harvesting"
	quest.612FFB9A3F47DA28.quest_desc: [
		"Deep within the toxic, fiery depths of the **Fire Swamp**, a terrifying multi-headed reptile makes its nest."
		""
		"The **Hydra** breathes continuous sheets of absolute flame, launches explosive mortar payloads, and regenerates extra heads as you sever them. Attack its open mouths while it breathes fire to inflict maximum critical damage metrics!"
		""
		"Slaying the monster yields **Fiery Blood**, unlocking the capability to forge ultimate, auto-repairing Fiery weapon sets."
	]
	quest.612FFB9A3F47DA28.title: "&4The Fire Swamp Hydra"
	quest.61884EB3C8E7C66A.quest_subtitle: "- Slay Elder Guardian"
	quest.61884EB3C8E7C66A.title: "Elder Guardian"
	quest.62F6D91BEE4132DF.quest_desc: [
		"Buried deep inside grand brick **Lich Towers**, an ancient undead sorcerer surrounds himself with illusion mirrors and projectile-reflecting shield shields."
		""
		"**The Trial**: You cannot damage the **Twilight Lich** directly while his golden shields orbit his frame. Stand firm and use a sword to precisely deflect his flying magical projectiles right back into his face to shatter his defenses!"
		""
		"Defeating him grants powerful **Scepters** (Life Draining, Teleporting, or Summoning variants) that assist beautifully in combat grids."
	]
	quest.62F6D91BEE4132DF.title: "&eThe Twilight Lich Tower"
	quest.64C17F1715ECA83B.quest_desc: [
		"You feel a &dstrange pull&r from the &5arcane&r..."
		""
		"&aUnlock&r the &6ancient craft&r by forging your first &9Enchanting Table&r."
		""
		"&7This is only the beginning&r — &dgreater&r &5mysteries&r lie beneath the runes."
	]
	quest.64C17F1715ECA83B.title: "The &eSecrets&r of &9Enchanting"
	quest.67707E55CA885367.quest_desc: [
		"Some relics cannot be crafted by mortal hands; they must be torn out of ancient structure vaults or harvested from rare end-game boss drops."
		""
		"Hunt for **The One Ring** or the mythical **Glowstone Charm**."
		""
		"These hidden items grant permanent night vision, completely nullify specific environmental hazards, and multiply your active aura stats beautifully."
	]
	quest.67707E55CA885367.title: "&eLost Antiquities"
	quest.67C3D10ADC5022B5.quest_desc: [
		"To catch the rarest, most magical creatures hidden beneath the waves, a basic wooden stick isn't going to cut it."
		""
		"Step into **Aquaculture 2** by crafting an **Iron Fishing Rod**."
		""
		"Unlike vanilla rods, this upgraded tooling allows you to apply specialized hooks and custom bait to boost your catch speeds across diverse biomes drastically!"
	]
	quest.67C3D10ADC5022B5.title: "&bAngler’s Attunement"
	quest.68B7309BFB4565F3.quest_subtitle: "- Slay 3x Iron Golem"
	quest.68B7309BFB4565F3.title: "&7System Failure"
	quest.68E2BC858656112A.quest_desc: [
		"[&4Guild Master&r] &6Fuze&r:"
		"  "
		"You've exceeded all of my expectations, proving strength, honor, and unwavering resolve. "
		""
		"Today, you rise to the pinnacle of our ranks—S-Class, the strongest of all. "
		""
		"Wear this title with pride and responsibility. "
		""
		"The realm looks up to you now as its greatest defender."
		""
		""
		"[&6Are you the strongest slime because you are Mikami Satoru, "
		"&6or are you Mikami Satoru because you are the strongest slime?&r]"
	]
	quest.68E2BC858656112A.quest_subtitle: "Disaster-class beings capable of immense destruction."
	quest.68E2BC858656112A.title: "[&bS&r] - Rank missions"
	quest.68E3C3086C6EF216.quest_subtitle: "Donate 100x Gold coin to get 1x Stellar Gold coin"
	quest.68E3C3086C6EF216.title: "Exchange &aGold&r coins for &6Stellar&r coin"
	quest.697D812AA4710667.quest_desc: [
		"[&6???&r] &bSunWine&r:"
		"  "
		"\"Well, well… If it isn’t one of the realm’s finest, stepping into my domain. An &bS-Rank&r adventurer, no less. The weight of your power clings to you like a second shadow, impressive.\""
		""
		"\"Welcome to the &l&cCrucibel of Power&r, where the worthy rise and the unworthy fade into forgotten echoes. The name's &bSunWine&r, and I can grant you power beyond your wildest dreams... if you can pass my trials that is\""
		""
		"\"So tell me, hero… are you ready to face what lies ahead? Are you prepared to prove that your spirit is unyielding, your purpose unshakable? Step forward, and let's see if you're worthy of the power that awaits.\""
	]
	quest.697D812AA4710667.quest_subtitle: "- Requires [&bS&r] - Rank Missions unlocked"
	quest.697D812AA4710667.title: "&l&cCrucible of Power"
	quest.6A50F79F2D7A3CCD.quest_subtitle: "- Slay 3x Giant Ant"
	quest.6A50F79F2D7A3CCD.title: "Giant Ant"
	quest.6D3980B951E0FB07.title: "Haze"
	quest.6E363294F2B3B69F.title: "[Repeatable] Enchantments [Choice]"
	quest.6EBCA14F5B8E6E09.quest_desc: [
		"{image:btrultima:textures/skill/ultimate/azathoth.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"[&l&ePassives&r]:"
		""
		"+50 &6Spatial/Wind/Fire Damage&r"
		""
		"&6Void Vacuum&r [&eIn Slot&r]"
		""
		"- Gives a &btotal&r of &620 SHP&r dmg &btick&r, corrosion &cdmg&r and &4fear 4&r effects for &b30secs&r on &chit&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:btrultima:textures/skill/ultimate/azathoth.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"&6Point Zero&r [&eIn Slot&r]"
		""
		"- Instantly &cbreaks&r any &bbarrier&r. "
		""
		"- Nullifications are &etreated&r as &cnon-existent&r. "
		""
		"- Ignores &cdodges&r and &4crit damage&r. "
		""
		"- &5Spatial Blockage&r is &cignored&r. "
		""
		"- Bypasses &6Holy Field&r and &6Infinity Prison&r"
		""
		"- &4Immune&r to &6Time Stop&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:btrultima:textures/skill/ultimate/azathoth.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"&6Matter Repulsion&r [&eIs Toggled&r]"
		""
		"- &cEntities&r in the &eradius&r of &b10 blocks&r get &cpushed&r away. "
		""
		"- Every &cnot allied&r entity that gets &b5 blocks&r close and is &c1% weaker&r than the &aplayer&r or that is &b10% below&r their &amax HP&r, will &6immediately&r die. "
		""
		"- Every &cprojectile&r (Not &6Magic&r) or &4physical attack&r is &cignored&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:btrultima:textures/skill/ultimate/azathoth.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"&6Isolation&r [&eTrue Passive&r]"
		""
		"- &6Cleans&r every &charmful effect&r from the &aplayer&r."
		""
		""
		"&6Dragon Unification&r [&eTrue Passive&r]"
		""
		"- Upon acquiring &4Azathoth&r, your &9EP&r will &aincrease&r by a &2grand&r total of &b162.000.000&r, divided by &6Aura&r and &9MP&r, each &b82.000.000&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:btrultima:textures/skill/ultimate/azathoth.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"[&l&cModes&r]:"
		""
		"&6Darkness Gravity Vortex&r [&cMode 1&r]"
		""
		"- Create a &4black hole&r that expands &ccontinuously&r, pulling &aeveryone&r in &b50 radius&r blocks as it &4absorbs&r &ceverything&r and &aeveryone&r below &b5%&r of your &9maximum EP&r around, dealing &c20.000 damage&r and draining &9200.000MP&r from those who are &astronger&r in &b10 base&r + &a40 max&r power &bradius&r blocks. "
		""
		"- The &alonger&r you &chold it&r, the less &bcooldown&r you'll obtain."
		""
		"- Gaining &6100%&r of their &9EP&r by the &efirst time&r. "
		""
		"- It's &cabsorption&r getting &abigger&r as it's &2size&r does. "
		""
		"- Feed it &buntil&r it &cexplodes&r into his &4disappearance&r from &5reality&r, &ceaten&r by it's &aown&r power, only leaving &6chaos&r behind. "
		""
		"- Acquire any &6Ultimate skill&r and &ebelow&r with this &4power&r that was &agiven&r, but &cdo not&r allow it to get into &ayour&r mind as &athy&r is &bonly&r a &evessel&r to &4Azathoth&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:btrultima:textures/skill/ultimate/azathoth.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"&6Soul Consumption&r [&cMode 2&r]"
		""
		"- Kill &eanything&r below &b5%&r of your &9maximum EP&r or that is with &b10%&r below their &amax HP&r that defies &6you&r in the &bradius&r of &b40 blocks&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:btrultima:textures/skill/ultimate/azathoth.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		"&6Gluttony&r [&cMode 3&r]"
		""
		"- &cConsume&r and &4absorb&r anything in &ayour&r path with a &eradius&r of &b3 to 50&r blocks, &cstealing&r their &6skills&r, acquire any &6Ultimate&r and &ebelow&r with this &4power&r, dealing &c5.000 damage&r and draining &950.000MP&r from &athose&r who are &2stronger&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:btrultima:textures/skill/ultimate/azathoth.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"&6Nihility Collapse&r [&cMode 4&r]"
		""
		"- Weapon &cattacks&r deal &bfour times&r their &cnormal damage&r for &b10 minutes&r."
		""
		""
		"&6Imaginary Space&r [&cMode 5&r]"
		""
		"- &cCrouch&r + &6Letter&r for &esub-mode&r."
		""
		"1 -> A &6storage&r with &balmost&r infinite &5space&r."
		""
		"2 -> A &6dimension&r under &ayour&r control, &abuild&r, &cdestroy&r as &ayou&r prefer. "
		""
		"- It's &6infinite&r space, &cnever-ending&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:btrultima:textures/skill/ultimate/azathoth.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"&6Multidimensional Barrier&r [&cMode 6&r]"
		""
		"- Acquire &b10 times&r your &amax hp&r as &bbarrier points&r while also &ccancelling&r most &4damage sources&r with &9lower MP&r cost (&b15.000&r Base + &cdamage taken&r)."
		""
		""
		"&6Spacetime Domination&r [&cMode 7&r]"
		""
		"- &cCrouch&r + &6Letter&r for &esub-mode&r."
		""
		"1 -> &6Time Stop"
		""
		"2 -> &6Time Warp"
		""
		"3 -> &6Instant Motion"
	]
	quest.6EBCA14F5B8E6E09.quest_subtitle: "- Mastered &6Spacetime Domination, Raphael, Beelzebuth, Veldora, Velgrynd&r + &b50.000&c souls&r or &6Hero Egg&r + &b50&r &eSubordinates&r + Cost &965.000.000 MP"
	quest.6EBCA14F5B8E6E09.title: "&4Void God Azathoth"
	quest.6FE444B50AA13B17.quest_subtitle: "- Slay &5Charybdis"
	quest.6FE444B50AA13B17.title: "&5Ruler of the Skies"
	quest.7001A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to the ultimate mastery over time and space. A **TARDIS** (Time And Relative Dimension In Space) is a sentient, multidimensional capsule that is vastly bigger on the inside."
		""
		"To begin cultivating your capsule, you must find or grow a **TARDIS Coral Seed**."
		""
		"Plant the seed on a blocks layer of soul sand or quartz, nurture its early growth phases, and wait for the time-vessel console matrix to fully materialize in physical reality!"
	]
	quest.7001A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_subtitle: "Bigger on the inside."
	quest.7001A2B3C4D5E6F7.title: "&6The Seed of Time"
	quest.7002A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_desc: [
		"Your capsule cannot safely navigate the vortex streams or maintain its interior gravity grid without **Artron Energy**."
		""
		"Locate or engineer an **Artron Capacitor** block and place it flat against your central console layout matrix."
		""
		"Feed your capsule raw fuel or park it near active vortex anomalies to pump continuous energy straight into your flight banks!"
	]
	quest.7002A2B3C4D5E6F7.title: "&bFueling the Mainframe"
	quest.7003A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_desc: [
		"Every Time Lord requires a tool to diagnose anomalies, unlock locked hatches, and reconfigure electronic grids instantly."
		""
		"Craft the **Sonic Screwdriver**."
		""
		"By clicking individual blocks or aiming at mechanisms, you can remotely interact with redstone components, scan block properties, or cleanly configure your TARDIS subsystems from outside the capsule door!"
	]
	quest.7003A2B3C4D5E6F7.title: "&bSonic Diagnostics"
	quest.7004A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_desc: [
		"Tired of running all the way back to your physical ship exterior just to materialize somewhere else?"
		""
		"Craft a **TARDIS Remote** and bind it natively to your console core block."
		""
		"With this device resting in your main hand, you can forcefully issue a **Recall Command** to make your capsule materialize right at your feet, anywhere across space!"
	]
	quest.7004A2B3C4D5E6F7.title: "&bVortex Keypad Link"
	quest.7005A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_desc: [
		"By default, your TARDIS looks like a standard blue police telephone box, which can attract unnecessary attention from hostile monsters or opposing player factions."
		""
		"Upgrade your hull systems by configuring the **Chameleon Circuit** manual options on the console table."
		""
		"This allows your capsule to disguise itself seamlessly as trees, stone boulders, statues, or structural base pillars to completely mask your point of entry!"
	]
	quest.7005A2B3C4D5E6F7.title: "&aStructural Camouflage"
	quest.7006A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_desc: [
		"Why travel linearly when you can chart coordinate arrays mathematically? Pull levers, adjust dials, and engage the **Space-Time Throttle** mechanisms."
		""
		"Locking targeted X, Y, and Z parameters allows your TARDIS to enter the vortex stream, forcefully teleporting your entire interior base infrastructure clean across dimensions safely!"
	]
	quest.7006A2B3C4D5E6F7.title: "&eDimensional Astrogation"
	quest.7007A2B3C4D5E6F7.quest_desc: [
		"You have completely mastered the intricate mechanical protocols of the space-time continuum."
		""
		"By growing a sentient core, routing Artron loops, deploying sonics, and utilizing advanced spatial remotes, the constraints of time mean absolutely nothing to you."
		""
		"Claim this ultimate bounty as a grand Master of the Vortex!"
	]
	quest.7007A2B3C4D5E6F7.title: "&5&lLord of Space and Time"
	quest.71244B0010F597E8.quest_subtitle: "- Slay 3x Phantom "
	quest.71244B0010F597E8.title: "Phantom"
	quest.713F0FC7C37A8BD7.quest_subtitle: "- Slay 5x Blaze"
